1
00:00:32,030 --> 00:00:33,670
I heard you

2
00:00:33,880 --> 00:00:36,430
used to live in a big mansion,
sleep in a big bed,

3
00:00:36,430 --> 00:00:38,160
with pretty chicks all around.

4
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:40,960
Now you're scrubbing toilets for us.

5
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:43,000
Does it feel good?

6
00:00:43,740 --> 00:00:45,820
Mr. He, why so quiet?

7
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:47,710
Do you think

8
00:00:48,020 --> 00:00:50,380
talking to people like us is beneath you?

9
00:00:50,490 --> 00:00:52,170
Still putting on airs with me?

10
00:00:52,470 --> 00:00:53,840
Who do you think you are?

11
00:00:55,240 --> 00:00:56,970
A son-in-law of the Wen family.

12
00:00:56,990 --> 00:00:59,270
You're just my dog here!

13
00:01:00,670 --> 00:01:01,470
Get a problem?

14
00:01:01,950 --> 00:01:04,319
Clenching your fist, want to hit me?

15
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:06,430
Come on, hit me! Hit me!

16
00:01:06,690 --> 00:01:07,970
Screw you!

17
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:10,000
You wanna fight?

18
00:01:10,840 --> 00:01:11,890
Eat dirt!

19
00:01:13,870 --> 00:01:14,930
What are you doing?

20
00:01:19,760 --> 00:01:20,430
Sir,

21
00:01:20,770 --> 00:01:22,000
we're doing the public a favor.

22
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:23,270
This guy? Let me tell you:

23
00:01:23,270 --> 00:01:25,010
he used to cheat and bully people,
commit all manners of crimes.

24
00:01:25,010 --> 00:01:26,010
We're just teaching him a lesson,

25
00:01:26,010 --> 00:01:27,840
for doing good for society

26
00:01:28,120 --> 00:01:30,380
and getting rid of an evil for the people.

27
00:01:30,880 --> 00:01:32,330
Looks like you want to get tased again.

28
00:01:32,330 --> 00:01:32,979
No, no, no.

29
00:01:33,009 --> 00:01:34,550
We're just kidding, just kidding.

30
00:01:34,550 --> 00:01:35,479
Stand straight!

31
00:01:37,800 --> 00:01:39,520
You, come with me.

32
00:01:50,680 --> 00:01:52,710
Sir, have you met my people?

33
00:01:52,800 --> 00:01:53,479
Is the money enough?

34
00:01:53,479 --> 00:01:55,200
If not, I'll have someone send more.

35
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:56,229
As long as you take good care of me,

36
00:01:56,229 --> 00:01:59,229
there will be plenty of benefits for you
in the future.

37
00:02:00,020 --> 00:02:01,180
Go in, Mr. He.

38
00:02:17,750 --> 00:02:18,420
What?

39
00:02:19,450 --> 00:02:20,800
Who are you?

40
00:02:20,829 --> 00:02:22,390
Wh- What are you doing?

41
00:02:23,540 --> 00:02:25,100
He Mu wants to bribe us.

42
00:02:25,360 --> 00:02:26,450
Wishful thinking.

43
00:02:30,030 --> 00:02:32,100
Boss, I found it.

44
00:02:33,710 --> 00:02:36,110
Wen Yan didn't die back then.

45
00:02:37,230 --> 00:02:38,829
That car accident was faked.

46
00:02:38,920 --> 00:02:41,350
The one cremated was
an unidentified female corpse.

47
00:02:41,350 --> 00:02:42,680
Not only did she not die,

48
00:02:42,850 --> 00:02:45,850
but she was also hidden in Wenshan Group
by Wen Yanhui.

49
00:02:51,329 --> 00:02:53,690
[Personnel Adjustment of
Wenshan Group]

50
00:02:51,450 --> 00:02:52,870
Wenshan Group announced

51
00:02:52,870 --> 00:02:53,840
a major personnel adjustment today:

52
00:02:53,840 --> 00:02:55,630
Wen Jianan,
granddaughter of Chairman Wen Yanhui,

53
00:02:55,520 --> 00:02:57,210
[Dearest: Episode 15]

54
00:02:55,630 --> 00:02:56,710
has officially returned to the group.

55
00:02:56,710 --> 00:02:58,590
It is reported
that she and her grandfather

56
00:02:58,590 --> 00:03:00,080
will jointly promote
the highly anticipated

57
00:03:00,080 --> 00:03:01,470
Xingji Entertainment Complex
development project.

58
00:03:01,470 --> 00:03:02,430
Industry insiders analyze

59
00:03:02,430 --> 00:03:03,190
that this move marks

60
00:03:03,190 --> 00:03:04,980
the official entry of
the third-generation successor

61
00:03:04,980 --> 00:03:07,380
into the core management of Wenshan Group.

62
00:03:10,200 --> 00:03:12,280
Ayan, look.

63
00:03:14,350 --> 00:03:15,360
The group is getting better and better

64
00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:17,090
under my management, isn't it?

65
00:03:17,200 --> 00:03:18,829
If the land of Xingji

66
00:03:18,850 --> 00:03:20,430
can be successfully developed,

67
00:03:20,430 --> 00:03:22,220
its status in Xinggang

68
00:03:23,280 --> 00:03:24,950
will be untouchable.

69
00:03:29,310 --> 00:03:30,590
You told me back then

70
00:03:30,930 --> 00:03:32,930
that the group's success owed to you

71
00:03:35,030 --> 00:03:36,030
and without you,

72
00:03:37,190 --> 00:03:38,560
I would be nothing.

73
00:03:44,910 --> 00:03:45,620
Ayan,

74
00:03:45,880 --> 00:03:49,720
I kept you alive just so
you can see

75
00:03:51,490 --> 00:03:54,090
that I can do better than you
with your own eyes.

76
00:03:55,420 --> 00:03:58,180
I am the real master of the group.

77
00:04:35,310 --> 00:04:38,340
Dad, you're back.

78
00:04:41,850 --> 00:04:43,240
My dear dad.

79
00:04:45,620 --> 00:04:47,700
Come have a drink with me.

80
00:04:48,800 --> 00:04:50,270
Drinking like this all day,

81
00:04:50,270 --> 00:04:51,760
you are really hopeless.

82
00:04:54,680 --> 00:04:55,510
Dad,

83
00:04:56,690 --> 00:05:00,130
but today is the anniversary of
Mom's passing.

84
00:05:01,390 --> 00:05:02,920
Don't you miss her?

85
00:05:04,340 --> 00:05:05,710
Don't you always say

86
00:05:06,230 --> 00:05:08,110
that Mom is your favorite?

87
00:05:08,150 --> 00:05:09,470
But why?

88
00:05:10,010 --> 00:05:13,410
Why do you never allow me to
visit her grave to pay my respects?

89
00:05:15,490 --> 00:05:17,220
Your mom is buried in hometown.

90
00:05:17,640 --> 00:05:19,040
A long journey from here.

91
00:05:19,140 --> 00:05:21,830
Besides, paying respects isn't
about formalities.

92
00:05:21,830 --> 00:05:23,490
As long as she is in your heart.

93
00:05:25,070 --> 00:05:25,830
Besides,

94
00:05:26,040 --> 00:05:27,030
after this drink,

95
00:05:27,030 --> 00:05:28,220
sober up tomorrow.

96
00:05:28,480 --> 00:05:30,540
The Wens shouldn't behave like this.

97
00:05:32,210 --> 00:05:33,120
Got it.

98
00:05:44,920 --> 00:05:46,240
My dear dad.

99
00:05:46,510 --> 00:05:48,310
Have a drink with me.

100
00:05:49,890 --> 00:05:51,350
I'll have Ahao make a copy.

101
00:06:38,350 --> 00:06:39,060
Mom.

102
00:06:51,670 --> 00:06:53,500
Mom, I'm Wen Xin.

103
00:06:53,730 --> 00:06:54,440
Mom.

104
00:06:55,430 --> 00:06:56,190
Xinxin.

105
00:06:57,450 --> 00:06:59,720
My Xinxin, Xinxin.

106
00:07:05,120 --> 00:07:06,120
For so many years,

107
00:07:07,310 --> 00:07:09,170
you've been locked up here by him.

108
00:07:12,680 --> 00:07:14,390
The beast,

109
00:07:15,160 --> 00:07:16,240
I'll kill him.

110
00:07:17,070 --> 00:07:17,920
Time's running out.

111
00:07:17,920 --> 00:07:19,040
Let's go.

112
00:07:19,860 --> 00:07:21,830
Mom, we'll get you out of here.

113
00:07:24,080 --> 00:07:24,640
Go.

114
00:07:24,950 --> 00:07:25,750
Jianan,

115
00:07:27,130 --> 00:07:28,290
my child.

116
00:07:29,050 --> 00:07:31,130
Mom finally gets to see you.

117
00:07:32,380 --> 00:07:34,300
I finally get to see you.

118
00:07:50,470 --> 00:07:51,659
So,

119
00:07:52,570 --> 00:07:54,720
I'm the child you had with Wen Yanhui.

120
00:08:00,400 --> 00:08:01,530
For all these years,

121
00:08:02,920 --> 00:08:04,680
he locked you up here

122
00:08:04,840 --> 00:08:06,720
and forced you to give birth to me.

123
00:08:07,890 --> 00:08:10,330
I'm sorry, my child.

124
00:08:11,560 --> 00:08:12,730
For all these years,

125
00:08:12,820 --> 00:08:15,470
you've both suffered so much.

126
00:08:16,600 --> 00:08:17,800
Why are you apologizing?

127
00:08:17,800 --> 00:08:19,460
You didn't do anything wrong.

128
00:08:19,520 --> 00:08:21,230
It was that damn Wen Yanhui

129
00:08:21,470 --> 00:08:23,030
who ruined your life.

130
00:08:26,190 --> 00:08:27,510
We'll get you out of here.

131
00:08:27,510 --> 00:08:30,340
Let's make that man pay the price.

132
00:08:33,440 --> 00:08:35,960
I can't leave. I can't leave.

133
00:08:36,720 --> 00:08:37,480
Why?

134
00:08:37,799 --> 00:08:39,610
Once he finds out the truth,

135
00:08:40,159 --> 00:08:41,760
he will do whatever it takes.

136
00:08:42,679 --> 00:08:44,530
He could persecute me then

137
00:08:44,900 --> 00:08:47,470
so he can do it to you now.

138
00:08:48,190 --> 00:08:49,450
I'm not afraid of death

139
00:08:49,720 --> 00:08:51,440
but I can't watch you

140
00:08:52,290 --> 00:08:53,970
suffer because of me.

141
00:08:54,450 --> 00:08:56,770
But we can't just leave you here.

142
00:08:56,840 --> 00:09:00,480
I've been here for over twenty years.

143
00:09:01,920 --> 00:09:05,240
A day more or less doesn't matter to me.

144
00:09:06,940 --> 00:09:07,750
Xinxin,

145
00:09:08,520 --> 00:09:10,580
you've been holding on
all by yourself for so many years.

146
00:09:10,580 --> 00:09:11,950
I know all.

147
00:09:14,390 --> 00:09:15,240
Now,

148
00:09:15,260 --> 00:09:17,500
you're not alone finally.

149
00:09:18,250 --> 00:09:19,090
Jianan,

150
00:09:19,460 --> 00:09:21,540
I'm sorry

151
00:09:21,560 --> 00:09:23,440
for I missed your childhood.

152
00:09:24,010 --> 00:09:27,440
But I can be your weapon since I'm here.

153
00:09:27,830 --> 00:09:29,540
When Wen Yanhui is brought to justice,

154
00:09:29,540 --> 00:09:31,020
when everything is over,

155
00:09:31,750 --> 00:09:34,790
we three can finally reunite.

156
00:09:34,810 --> 00:09:35,640
Okay?

157
00:09:36,630 --> 00:09:37,390
Okay.

158
00:09:39,780 --> 00:09:40,750
Next,

159
00:09:42,180 --> 00:09:43,940
just do as I say.

160
00:09:45,880 --> 00:09:46,550
Okay.

161
00:09:53,610 --> 00:09:54,700
You've been through a lot.
